'''Empress' Report 1''' (女王の研究報告1, ''Joō no Kenkyū Hōkoku 1'', "'''Queen's Research Report 1'''") is one of the maps unlocked after clearing [[The Gates of Aku|Unleashing the Cats]], and has several one-time rewards including an Aku [[Catfruit]] Seed. Just like the first series of [[Empress' Research]] maps, it has four stages and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Once completed, the player will unlock [[Empress' Report 2]], which drops another Aku Catfruit Seed. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

